<title>SPAIN: Spain's Repsol to pay interim dividend of 79 pta.</title>
<headline>Spain's Repsol to pay interim dividend of 79 pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Repsol said on Monday it would pay on January 9, 1997 an interim dividend of 79 pesetas gross against 1996 results.</p>
<p>A press note said the interim dividend was raised by eight percent from the previous year's 73 pesetas. Repsol's total 1995 dividend was 171 pesetas.</p>
<p>Repsol posted net profit for the first nine months of the year of 87 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, +341 5858.340</p>
</text>
